packs/review-gate/skills/codex/code-review/SKILL.md:23:**Who reviews.** The `reviewer` role in ACS (Models → Roles; `model-id --role reviewer --json`) is the pool, each family at its own flavor effort. A family's CLI follows its model id (`claude-…` → claude, `gpt-…` → codex, `grok-…` → grok); families whose CLI is not installed are skipped and one line names them. The run stops with a message naming the fix — never trying another vendor — when `model-id` is missing (`acs install-model-id`), the role is unset (you choose it at install: `acs packs install review-gate --set-role reviewer=<family>[,…]`) or missing, no family in it has its CLI, or a named reviewer has no CLI.
